stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Reported
  Reported --> Triaged: Validate issue report
  Triaged --> Assigned: Assign technician
  Triaged --> Rejected: Invalid / duplicate report
  Assigned --> InProgress: Technician accepts
  InProgress --> AwaitingParts: Parts required
  AwaitingParts --> InProgress: Parts received
  InProgress --> Resolved: Repair and diagnostics pass
  Resolved --> Closed: Reporter / supervisor confirms
  Resolved --> InProgress: Verification failed
  Closed --> [*]
  Rejected --> [*]
